BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"The Dispossessed" Book Club: Session #5
DTSTART:20261103T000000Z
DTEND:20261103T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20261106T005453Z
UID:a0a5038e33b78d2ce570@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/the-dispossessed-book-club-session-5">ht
 tps://actionnetwork.org/events/the-dispossessed-book-club-session-5</a></p
 >\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Join Philly DS
 A for an exploration of the anarchist philosophy through the Science Ficti
 on Novel <em>The Dispossessed </em>By Ursula K. Le Guin. Join to discuss\,
  understand\, and critique anarchist philosophy by examining an imagined e
 xample of what such a society could look like through virtual discussion.<
 /p><p>This is a <strong>theory light</strong><strong><em> </em></strong><s
 trong>reading group</strong>\, anarchist theory will be examined as option
 al supplements\, but any reading beyond the novel will be done together du
 ring the session.</p><p>This session will cover Chapters 7-8.</p><div><br>
 </div>\nSource: Philly DSA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/events
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
